+## SMAA
+
+`r_smaa` (0 off, 1 low, 2 medium, 3 high, 4 ultra) runs SMAA 1x after tonemapping. Based on the SMAA reference
+implementation by Jorge Jimenez, Jose I. Echevarria, Belen Masia, Fernando Navarro and Diego Gutierrez (MIT,
+https://github.com/iryoku/smaa). Needs the framebuffer path (`r_hdr 1` or MSAA) and GLSL 1.30+.
